#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This Procedure demonstrates how CarSim can be used to set up a crosswind test while the vehicle is driving on a low-mu surface.
#
#The crosswind fans produce 40 km/h wind first from the right side, then the left side.
#
#The driver controls specify a closed-loop speed control with a constant target speed of 100 kph, no brake pressure, and automatic gear selection using all available gears. The closed-loop driver path follower is used to keep the vehicle following a target path with no lateral offset.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

